e\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Amulet\"><img alt=\"Silver Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Silver_Amulet_3589d6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bunch of Troll Hair\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bunch_of_Troll_Hair_f8a673.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spear\"><img alt=\"Spear\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spear_5c898c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\"><img alt=\"Meat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meat_7cb26b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Carlin Cemetery\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"92\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carlin_Cemetery_fe4c79.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>'s Graveyard has been overrun by <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Trolls</a>. The entrance to the crypt has been locked to protect the citizens of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> from this potential enemy.\n</p><p>Carlin Graveyard is a simple 3 row, 24 plot cemetery with 18 graves (see image), all of which have nothing written on them (this excludes the two graves that cannot be read, the one with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Heaven%20Blossom\">heaven blossom</a> and the one with a moon flower on top). The caves are a good hunting place for newbies just arriving from <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>. This graveyard often has a Red Rose spawn each day. A hole in the south part of the cave leads to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworm</a> section of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin%20Corym%20Cave\">Carlin Corym Cave</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Carlin Graveyard 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"117\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carlin_Graveyard_1_d6cf7d.png\" width=\"105\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Carlin Graveyard 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"210\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carlin_Graveyard_2_31d8f5.png\" width=\"207\"/></span>\n</p><p><br/>\nThis graveyard contains the <a href=\"#/quest/fanfare-quest\">Fanfare Quest</a>, you will need a key from Carlin to complete it.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\"><img alt=\"Troll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Troll_b18126.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Troll</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">20</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">50</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">15 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-12× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Hand Axe (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Boots\">Leather Boots</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Leather Helmet (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spear\">Spear</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Studded Club (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Wooden Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Old%20Tome\">Heavy Old Tome</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Bunch of Troll Hair (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Amulet\">Silver Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["cults-of-tibia-quest","fanfare-quest"]}